sequenceDiagram
  participant Q as Requester
  participant C as Community/space
  participant V as Provider
  Q->>C: Ask for useful help
  C-->>Q: Acknowledge or expose request
  C->>V: Connect or surface request (optional)
  V-->>Q: Offer a possible response
  Q->>V: Choose whether to proceed
  V->>Q: Provide help
  Q-->>C: Share result only if desired
  C-->>C: Learn and adapt locally
